meta {
  name: Get market insights
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/api/insights
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Always 200 with "state":
  - READY: insights of the published market snapshot.
  - GENERATING: the job for the published snapshot is pending or running; the previous publication may be served.
  - FAILED: the job failed ("failureReason": AUTH, CONFIG, RATE_LIMITED, TIMEOUT, TRANSIENT, INVALID_OUTPUT, MARKET_DATA, PUBLISH, SUPERSEDED, UNKNOWN or INSIGHTS_DISABLED); the previous publication may be served.
  - STALE: only an older publication exists and nothing is running.
  - AWAITING_DATA: the ETL has not published a snapshot yet; lists are empty.
  Compare requestedBucketKey (published snapshot) with availableBucketKey (content served) to flag stale content.
  Only READY is cached. 500 INSIGHT_PAYLOAD_UNREADABLE when the stored payload cannot be read; 503 MARKET_DATA_UNAVAILABLE when the ETL views cannot be read.
}
